# TEST FIXTURE (id 220): the C5 world systems (contract section 42). Not part of the game: reached only by the host harness (tools/host_world, `make c5sys`).
#   * the lake (i 18..29, j 3..12): Hidrodeslizador (surf), the water / fishing tables, a rock standing in the water (24,7), a shore spawn `shore` (17,8) facing the water
#   * Empuje: boulders `b` and pits `h` / `H` (flags 790 / 791): A (4,3) -> pit (7,3); B (4,5) against an invisible wall; C two boulders in a row (4,7) (5,7); D (8,5) towards a step trigger (9,5);
#     E (11,3) -> pit (11,5) pushed SW from (11,2); F (6,9) free S push, (9,9) S push blocked by a wall flank; G (15,10) pushed east to the lake
#   * the sleeping creature `Z` (12,17) in a corridor of invisible walls `W` (rows 16 / 18, i 10..14); the Autopista gate `g` (9,14); a bike slope (20,14) .. (24,18)
@map test_c5sys
@size 32 20
@interior no
@bg 0
@fill dirt_a
@spawn start 2 10 SE
@spawn shore 17 8 SE
@flag hole_a 790
@flag hole_b 791
@encounters water rate=255
  flitter 5 5 1
@end
@encounters fish_old
  muncrit 5 5 1
@end
@encounters fish_good rate=128
  flitter 10 12 3
  muncrit 10 10 1
@end
@encounters fish_super
  flitter 20 25 3
  muncrit 22 24 1
@end
@legend
  .  tile=dirt_a
  ~  tile=sea_o
  r  tile=sea_o object=boulder
  b  tile=dirt_a boulder=yes
  h  tile=dirt_a hole=hole_a
  H  tile=dirt_a hole=hole_b
  W  tile=dirt_a solid=yes
  X  tile=dirt_a interact=step script=noop
  g  tile=dirt_a interact=step script=gate
  s  tile=slope_s
  Z  tile=dirt_a sleeper=muncrit level=30 npc=vecino face=SE
@grid
  ................................
  ................................
  ................................
  ....b..h...b......~~~~~~~~~~~~..
  ..................~~~~~~~~~~~~..
  ....bW..bX.H......~~~~~~~~~~~~..
  ..................~~~~~~~~~~~~..
  ....bb............~~~~~~r~~~~~..
  ..................~~~~~~~~~~~~..
  ......b..bW.......~~~~~~~~~~~~..
  ...............b..~~~~~~~~~~~~..
  ..................~~~~~~~~~~~~..
  ..................~~~~~~~~~~~~..
  ................................
  .........g..........s...........
  .....................s..........
  ..........WWWWW.......s.........
  ............Z..........s........
  ..........WWWWW.........s.......
  ................................
@script noop step
    end
@end
@script gate step
    jf on_bike pass
    say gl.c5a.gate.bike
    hero_walk NW 1
  pass:
    end
@end
